    "name": "Bakery Cafe Simulator: Prologue",
    "steam_appid": 3669720,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the first few hours of \u201cBakery Cafe Simulator\u201d solo or with up to 4 players online.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this prologue you'll find <strong>10 recipes</strong> to cook for your customers, including various coffee recipes and a few pastries such as cookies and cakes. <strong>Thirty or so customization elements</strong> for your store will also be available, allowing you to let your imagination run wild as you personalize your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build and furnish your caf\u00e9 according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the first few hours of \u201cBakery Cafe Simulator\u201d solo or with up to 4 players online.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this prologue you'll find <strong>10 recipes</strong> to cook for your customers, including various coffee recipes and a few pastries such as cookies and cakes. <strong>Thirty or so customization elements</strong> for your store will also be available, allowing you to let your imagination run wild as you personalize your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build and furnish your caf\u00e9 according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1747832695\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1747832695\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>",
    "short_description": "Start bake, build, and grow your dream bakery cafe with prologue now! Create delicious pastries, design your space, and serve customers. Play solo or with friends in online co-op to expand your business and experience the excitement of running a bustling cafe!",
